  "segments": [
    {
      "t0": 0.0,
      "t1": 16.0,
      "text": " Oh, let's see, um... This month we went to a really lovely wedding in Portugal, and it was just this whole trip."
    },
    {
      "t0": 16.0,
      "t1": 30.0,
      "text": " We hit up, like, Delft in the Netherlands, which I love, and then went down to Porto, and then the wedding in the Duro Valley, and, um..."
    },
    {
      "t0": 30.140000343322754,
      "t1": 60.140000343322754,
      "text": "-from there to Barcelona. That was great. And then we had an absolutely hellish flight back, where everything got cancelled and delayed and the-the gate agents were fucking useless."
    },
    {
      "t0": 53.970001220703125,
      "t1": 72.17000122070313,
      "text": " I've been thinking a lot about what I want to do next, and I'm not sure I have a good"
    },
    {
      "t0": 72.17000122070313,
      "t1": 73.17000122070313,
      "text": " answer."
    },
    {
      "t0": 73.17000122070313,
      "t1": 88.81000122070313,
      "text": " I think it intersects pretty heavily with my ADHD."
    },
    {
      "t0": 89.375,
      "t1": 119.375,
      "text": "- because I just keep jumping around from project to project, I just don't fucking know. I should probably book another session with my therapist, I think I'm due for a therapy session. And I just need to get that shit on the books. I think it was kind of a mistake to not work with him."
    },
    {
      "t0": 118.73500061035156,
      "t1": 127.73500061035156,
      "text": " Well, I quit. I think I'm kind of overdue for that, but, um... you know."
    },
    {
      "t0": 129.73500061035156,
      "t1": 131.73500061035156,
      "text": " Water under the bridge."
    },
    {
      "t0": 134.73500061035156,
      "t1": 136.73500061035156,
      "text": " I..."
    },
    {
      "t0": 139.73500061035156,
      "t1": 145.73500061035156,
      "text": " I don't know. I just need a direction I can sink my teeth into and feel good about."
    },
    {
      "t0": 145.73500061035156,
      "t1": 148.13500061035157,
      "text": " and I feel like it's time to set that direction."
    },
    {
      "t0": 149.41000366210938,
      "t1": 179.41000366210938,
      "text": "- I've got a bunch of different ideas of what that direction could be, but they're kinda just like rough ideas, and I need something that I can like, commit to, and live with. I don't fuckin' know. I don't know what that is. AI coding has been really good for... when my brain's not working."
    },
    {
      "t0": 177.98499298095703,
      "t1": 183.58499298095703,
      "text": " And letting me be lazy, but I'm still trying to wrap my head around what it is, and kinda..."
    },
    {
      "t0": 185.18499298095702,
      "t1": 187.18499298095702,
      "text": " what it fucking means to me, you know?"
    },
    {
      "t0": 190.70499298095703,
      "t1": 191.70499298095703,
      "text": " Um..."
    },
    {
      "t0": 194.54499298095703,
      "t1": 195.54499298095703,
      "text": " I don't..."
    },
    {
      "t0": 197.10499298095704,
      "t1": 198.10499298095704,
      "text": " I don't..."
    },
    {
      "t0": 199.58499298095703,
      "t1": 200.58499298095703,
      "text": " I don't know."
    },
    {
      "t0": 201.74499298095702,
      "t1": 202.74499298095702,
      "text": " That's it."
    },
    {
      "t0": 204.14499298095703,
      "t1": 206.14499298095703,
      "text": " Oh, let's see, um..."
